        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FlipSum is a bold new twist on classic number puzzles! Inspired by sudoku, this brain-teasing series challenges you to flip, cancel, and balance numbers on a grid to match the target totals. It’s a thrilling game of logic, deduction, and number play—perfect for puzzle lovers who crave something fresh and clever. Get ready to see numbers in a whole new light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How To Play:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark numbers as positive, negative, or cancel them out. Only one number may be cancelled per row / column. Can you balance the entire grid so that each column / row adds up to the correct number?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Difficulty Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Counter Per Difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track Your Total Points To Show Off To Your Friends!</p></li></ul>",
